 "description": "This new generation PIV Card addresses current and future needs of both Federal & Corporate customers with built-in support for all the cryptographic algorithms defined in SP800-78-2 including TDEA, AES, RSA, ECDSA, & ECDH with all possible key sizes as well as key history for over 20 retired decryption keys. It offers Identity proofing (storage of personal data), User authentication, Card authentication, digital signature, encryption, and secure post issuance management in the PIV system. Its fingerprint match-on-card has been validated in the MINEX II PIV Biometric interoperability program.",
